NT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">및&nbsp;논문-무논문 과정 간 상호변경 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. 2013-1학기 산업 및 교육대학원 무논문 석사과정 신청안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013학년도 1학기 기준&nbsp; 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 3학기차 재학생으로서 무논문 석사과정을 신청하고자 하는 학생은 소정의 기간 내에 관련 서류를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 신청대상 : 산업 및 교육대학원 3학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 휴학 후 복학생은 반드시 복학신청 완료후 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 신청기간 : </span><font color=\"#0055ff\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 02. 25(월) ~ 02. 28(목) [4일간</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 다. 신청장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 라. 신청서류 : 대학원별 무논문 석사과정 신청원 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 신청서 작성 시 '총 취득학점' 및 '성적'은</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학적부-학적자료조회-성적에서 성적 조회 후 기재</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2. 2013-1학기 산업 및 교육대학원 논문-무논문 간 상호변경 신청안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013학년도 1학기 기준&nbsp; 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 4학기차 재학생으로서 논문과정과 무논문과정 간의 상호변경을 신청하고자 하는 학생은 아래의 내용을 숙지하신 후 소정의 기간에 관련서류를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; 가. 신청대상 : 산업 및 교육대학원 4학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">① </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">무논문 석사과정 신청자 중 논문과정으로 변경하고자하는 2013-1학기 기준 4학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">② 2013-1학기 기준 4학기차 재학생으로 논문과정에서 무논문 석사과정을 신규로 신청하고자 하는 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(단, 논문과정과 무논문과정간의 상호변경은 단 1회에 한하므로 신중하게 변경해야 함)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; 나. 신청기간 :</span><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-f